msgstr "Minimum match for automatic subtitles"

msgctxt "#32655"
msgid "Auto-sub skips every subtitle whose release match is below this number (in percent). 0 turns the limit off. Rows with no match number (the video's own subtitle, a file beside the video) are not filtered. The instant lane always needs at least 90."
msgstr "Auto-sub skips every subtitle whose release match is below this number (in percent). 0 turns the limit off. Rows with no match number (the video's own subtitle, a file beside the video) are not filtered. The instant lane always needs at least 90."

